了骇人的一击。众神中最强大的存在就这样倒在自己的儿女手中，脸也被压进尘土。”#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"20088c8979d427e647c7010bdc83d51e4a134a6ee75b2ecd181401e86870e6d2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5462a3c0ddeb1313f77d7fe1dfcda4f370ea77fd6f5d392b15109651e3c6ee7a","logical_entry_identity":"7e13340fa4ef12de54646a27978b22e5757a4045cf65726f93752a40f6e2d2b3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"All enemies have 200% more life","source_tag":"_t","target":"所有敌人血量增加 200%"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a7d2fd2249a4aedc7a70a0f7379a885ab492a1c66d13fe64dc9269c693308fe3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"546809ee9b779590f838ebc7361ad80747391c9b240f66492612fa69b62487d6","logical_entry_identity":"e19e191b089712f8d22ae2a9310c302c33f1c74b5eb2c4a9763882118900fe70","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" of stability","source_tag":"entity name","target":"稳定之"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"014444b146be567c7b0eef91cfd6a727dfb63cbc3cbc2b4d9814d52b7340a010","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"546a6e96d9a4963931cdace25ab51024f000a60dd3709b5b8f6ef58a75a4d598","logical_entry_identity":"6833eb6b9548f8423a7a602246f4e412fae372370e473064ec807257363ef3ca","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Activate some of your inner magic, using it to power your abilities.  For the next %d turns all active talents will be used without resource cost.\n\t\tYour resources must still be high enough to initially power the talent and failure rates (etc.) still apply.\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"激活你的内在潜力，以提高你的能力。\n\t\t在接下来 %d 回合中可无消耗使用技能。\n\t\t你的能量值仍需要满足使用这些技能的最低能量需求，且技能仍有几率会失败。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cdb4e9c611f556ffe7b371c81e29f17cc6d800bddbe1c8bf7cabf9ce8c90bcfd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"546ab2881c38edba7d855884f52d4ab8ca23b6bc6f2cf8e8f2754c3e29a4e45f","logical_entry_identity":"c2f9fcedc1ed4ed0042399cb5349fb03f114ff098ab76fb3ba6c14e1ba0d9106","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* You have explored t