b68bc23091","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"547f4d4fc442957af6092765de1b4b0613eb75b766a8b379b344d7021e432c79","logical_entry_identity":"5e261a13cdd3d7134c7bfe6adba5a2e49b1e8e8f665aa3aac289a23a1ed0eb48","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Worn by a villain long forgotten, this armor was powered by the blood of thousands of innocents. Decrepit and old, the dark lord died in solitude, his dominion crumbled, his subjects gone. Only this cuirass remained, dying to finally taste fresh blood again.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这件胸甲属于一个早已被人遗忘的暴君，成千上万无辜死者的鲜血强化了这件铠甲。黑暗领主最终在衰老与虚弱中孤独的死去，他的统治分崩离析，他的人民四散而去。只有这件胸甲被保留了下来，渴望着再次品尝鲜血的味道。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a6ffb0529cac1d61d50d4bbeb1867813c3453603ae69adf89c2df6421614e83a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5485c65c37f4e7c5b464dbdb1f03d00200071dacf41d1c5150cac9a235ad21c6","logical_entry_identity":"41257b64d2c6844812c382936f70f74aa3e4da8e0bafec886b96445428d45eed","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Fire a precise shot dealing %d%% weapon damage, with 100 increased accuracy. This shot will bypass other enemies between you and your target.\nOnly usable against marked targets, and consumes the mark on hit.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"瞄准目标头部发射穿透性弹药，造成 %d%% 武器伤害。\n此次攻击额外获得 100 命中，且能穿透目标以外单位。\n只能对被标记的单位使用，使用将消耗掉标记。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ea943890dd11ac83370d0f38a62ead536e5a316fe1a80a1aa21acc3e3ff945a0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"54868dfa293cb1672fc11a05a8b43b29f73f590925723fd44b76237c4238c4c0","logical_entry_identity":"a389950b5e8555889593b63b996c54fcf5deee345e5f7fcd645c3348d6237b94","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Drop how many?","source_tag":"_t","target":"丢下多少？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c4ba0cdd425d99906901dda1268b4f30acceec0d85799a88d7274aa5b7fb694b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"548c4b31edb9d38efdb6bcb12e3655dbe92f1acc37cf77292e8aa41b51d0aeda","logical_entry_identity":"6cb4ed27585ff137ffd775d7b7bb5f7dad993e