8fc258e11e9","logical_entry_identity":"92e89f3bcad7c758ee4d14937fd560c499ecd8eee49d4b3d643bf019f86e48be","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Increases your golem's life, mana and stamina regeneration rates by %0.2f.\n\t\tAt level 1, 3 and 5, the golem also gains a new rune slot.\n\t\tEven without this talent, Golems start with three rune slots.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"增加傀儡 %0.2f 生命、法力和耐力回复。\n\t\t在等级 1、3、5 时，傀儡会增加 1 个新的符文孔。\n\t\t即使没有此天赋，傀儡默认也有 3 个符文孔。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bbb10de537e9d709d709a806111be0baa0d5fd4636935ed74eb4cf5408d56ffd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"54acc91aada3026dc580f37fc9b418622b6c6c030d5d35f8ddbf811556ae3bcb","logical_entry_identity":"f812a6c2d4dbf509b1328c0506c40af2f27de762cb3d5e564089c0b258a74cdd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"mindweaver","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"心灵编织者"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1f94abf3a96331280118ef11f3d7c4b6f8dcbdb6b2729b74c1a063d45b69a31c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"54bae219acb7d751ad6fef33767ddce736d32592350eec2eee345b8e321c08f7","logical_entry_identity":"724f3e95e4235a69bf9e86f19c3bca4c07fe550011ab43bfaf3bf0fa69aae499","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Tireless Combatant","source_tag":"talent type","target":"不倦战斗"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"55ebeaa21775a266729dbd110eeeb34ac11b01bd8bfdd11edb94d2b81e598fcb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"54bb112f9d51e4fd81e44c7477564249a7cd34a82ffb7ff8c1341d2a96cec739","logical_entry_identity":"725dee21625e3f4043fd9863ceda1d03b21e9f0c2f8ca4d7e929aaa45c047cfa","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You veil yourself in shadows and let them control you. While in the veil you become immune to status effects, and gain %d%% all damage reduction. Each turn you blink to a nearby foe within range %d, hitting it for %d%% darkness weapon damage. While this goes on you cannot be stopped unless you are killed, and you cannot control your character.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你融入暗影并被其支配，当你笼罩在阴影里时你对所有状态免疫，并减少 %d%% 所受伤害，每回合你可以闪到 1 个附近的敌人身边 (半径 %d)，对其造成 %d%% 暗影武器伤害。当此技能激活时除非死亡否则无法被打断，且你无法控制你的角色。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e6e0d1b7878b8d16242ce1edcef5e52d6f98876cc4e476753ed3b2b13a69b13f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"54bedb64d15e7b99260b7de54ba47030f238e7222dbbaf1a2c42b3f895b60f33","logical_entry_identity":"71b0d9aafccb79bb57e29341e422d2222eae0c8bb5d933ac7a62425f5ed7d4c3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"@Source@ teleports several targets to @Source@'s location.","source_tag":"_t","target":"@Source@将数名目标传送到@Source@的位置。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"febe7e41e5c1507c6becd61bf930c32a1411ecae3ff40f5f8bacd2cccf8d9708","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"54c2cf01e32bef8d40ca8d22c21eda5d0d62793940e0dfe798fd374c81420c33","logical_entry_identity":"730939634b8691ea812f1128f8f24e948d41989abaec59d5431ad0636efa678a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You take close notice of the target for the next 5 turns. If they attempt to use a non-instant talent you react with incredible speed, firing a shot dealing 25%% damage that causes the talent to fail and go on cooldown.\nThis shot is instant, cannot miss, and puts %d other talents on cooldown for %d turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你在接下来的 5 回合内密切关注目标。当其使用非瞬间技能时，你立刻做出反应，射出一箭造成 25%% 伤害打断技能并使其进入冷却。\n该攻击为瞬间击中，必中，并使其它 %d 个技能进入冷却 %d 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0415e4d42b09b410134fd7d225106e0a7b18108503fd4c3a16722af49ecf2d6b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"54c5e1df374fa3fa6a2f529f89ae751a30df2443a4559ebe3b016b45d7f7e82f","logical_entry_identity":"e1cceab86a54dab44856032242d4ba96406fc4cfcf67d69c2f8d18946c30146d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"-Vampire Mark","source_tag":"_t","target":"-吸血鬼印记"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"818b8ad04919489a95e0aaf45130547dce12dcb83c64ef45f6a2fd8550709d1c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"54c6630af0ed490ae355f1462bf446aa64ca12368598da3a0f